          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which collagen is best for athletes who are drug tested?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Choose a product with NSF Certified for Sport or Informed Sport certification and verify the exact product in the certifier's online database. Thorne Collagen Fit carries NSF Certified for Sport status, and Momentous sells a certified collagen as well. Diet certifications such as Keto Certified or NSF Gluten Free do not test for banned substances."
