              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Collagen research on skin and joints typically runs eight to twenty-four weeks, and the effects reported are modest. Taking it for two weeks and judging the results will almost always disappoint. Pick a studied dose of roughly 10 to 15 g, take it daily for at least two to three months, and judge it then.
